<title>JAPAN: Japan May utility direct crude burning falls- MITI.</title>
<headline>Japan May utility direct crude burning falls- MITI.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese electric power utilities purchased a total of 895,670 kl of crude oil for direct burning in May, down 6.7 percent from a year earlier, the trade ministry said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>Month-on-month, the May figure represents a 67.6 percent increase.</p>
</text>
